title: Status
on-arrival: {!if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
Q.party_actions_remaining = Q.max_party_actions - Q.month_party_actions;
Q.gov_actions_remaining = Q.max_actions - Q.month_actions;!}
new-page: true
is-special: true

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Party actions remaining: [+ party_actions_remaining +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="When in government, the number of actions available depends on the level of dissent within the coalition.">Total actions remaining</span>!}: [+ gov_actions_remaining +]

= Party

Resources available: [+ resources +]

<span style="color: var(--sfio);">**SFIO**</span> position: [? if {!return (((Q['sfio_toleration'] || 0)) !== 0);!}: toleration  ?][? if {!return (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0);!}: in government -  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['sfio_toleration'] || 0) == 0) && ((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0) == 0)) && ((Q['sfio_caretaker'] || 0) == 0));!}: opposition  ?][? if {!return (((Q['sfio_caretaker'] || 0)) !== 0);!}: caretaker government  ?] [? if {!return ((((Q['in_national_unity'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: National Unity government  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_revolutionary_front'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: Revolutionary Front  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_popular_front'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: Popular Front  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_left_cartel'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: Left Cartel  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_sfio_majority'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: SFIO majority  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_minority_government'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: minority government  ?][? if {!return ((((Q['in_emergency_government'] || 0)) !== 0) && (((Q['sfio_in_government'] || 0)) !== 0));!}: emergency government  ?]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

Popular Front enthusiasm: [+ popular_front_enthusiasm : enthusiasm +]

= Government

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The President of the Republic is officially the head of state and is a mostly ceremonial position.">Président de la République</span>!}: [? if president_party = "AD": <span style="color: var(--ard);">[+ president +]</span> ?] ([? if president_party = "AD": <span style="color: var(--ard);">**[+ president_party +]**</span>?])

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="President of the Council of Ministers - also called the Prime Minister, this is the head of government.">Président du Conseil</span>!}: [? if prime_minister_party = "I": <span style="color: var(--ind);">[+ prime_minister +]</span> ?] ([? if prime_minister_party = "I": <span style="color: var(--ind);">**[+ prime_minister_party +]**</span>?])

Chamber of Deputies composition:

<span style="color: var(--sfio);">**SFIO**</span>: [+ sfio_r +]% <span style="color: var(--prrrs);">**PRRRS**</span>: [+ prrrs_r +]% <span style="color: var(--pcf);">**PCF**</span>: [+ pcf_r +]% <span style="color: var(--usr);">**USR + Misc. Left**</span>: [+ usr_r +]% <span style="color: var(--ard);">**AD**</span>: [+ ad_r +]% <span style="color: var(--pdp);">**PDP + Misc. Right**</span>: [+ pdp_r +]% <span style="color: var(--fr);">**FR**</span>: [+ fr_r +]%

[? if sfio_in_government = 1: Budget: [+ budget +]  ?]

Next election: [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]

= Economics

Inflation: [+ inflation_2 +]%

Unemployment: [+ unemployed_2 +]%

Economic growth: [+ economic_growth_2 +]%

@politics

= Inter-Party Relations

<span style="color: var(--pcf);">**PCF**</span>: [+ pcf_relation : relationships +]

<span style="color: var(--prrrs);">**PRRRS**</span>: [+ prrrs_relation : relationships +]

<span style="color: var(--usr);">**USR + Misc. Left**</span>: [+ usr_relation : relationships +]

<span style="color: var(--ard);">**AD**</span>: [+ ad_relation : relationships +]

<span style="color: var(--fr);">**FR**</span>: [+ fr_relation : relationships +]

<span style="color: var(--pdp);">**PDP + Misc. Right**</span>: [+ pdp_relation : relationships +]

= Party Leadership

<span style="color: var(--pcf);">**PCF**</span>: Communism ([+ pcf_leader +])
